// Bottom-bar icons, EXACT-USE (boss 2026-10-27 18:44: "নিচে হবে হুবহু
// এইটা" — icons and everything the same). Sliced from the boss's own target
// image (1000225055_4_i70l.png, dark theme, 2048x360) into transparent PNGs,
// embedded here as data URIs — NOT redrawn SVGs, NOT Feather substitutes.
// Why data URIs, not require() PNG files: the GitHub connector's snapshot
// push accepts UTF-8 files ONLY and rejects binary contents, so PNG files
// cannot reach the repo through our only push route — data URIs keep the
// exact pixels in a pushable UTF-8 module (same pattern as trioIcons.ts).
// Colors are baked in (white/gold/purple/blue on dark circles); the row
// itself is a dark strip on every theme, so no tint is needed and no button
// can blend into any room theme (standing law, boss 17:55).
// Slice boxes (x0,y0,x1,y1) in the 2048x360 target:
//   micGear  (55,97)-(294,339)   circular mask r116 (dark circle + white mic+gear)
//   smiley   (754,157)-(880,280) black->transparent ramp (white outline)
//   calendar (1019,159)-(1143,280) black->transparent ramp (white outline)
//   speaker  (1226,181)-(1351,273) black->transparent ramp (gold glyph)
//   gamepad  (1462,100)-(1729,339) black->transparent ramp (purple + dark circle)
//   gift     (1753,101)-(1992,340) circular mask r114 (blue circle + white gift)

